# Guava is shaded into plantuml.jar and even the newest PlantUML release (1.2026.10)
# still ships 33.6.0; the fix is 33.7.2. The flaw is a DoS during Java deserialization
# of untrusted data, and PlantUML here only renders local diagram text, never
# deserializes external input. Remove once PlantUML bundles Guava >= 33.7.2.
CVE-2026-102554
